source:
非瀕死時一度だけ即死級攻撃
も生き残る。{c05}（支給品専用）{c02}
※「不退ノ構」発動時は無効。

target:
Taikun Zamuza Sharp Spear.
A spear from the elusive multi-shell crab;
carving it out takes skill.

A vine plant that bears flowers
like cannon barrels. Highly durable;
once dried, it can be used as rope.

Perhaps many long years have passed
since it broke;
the branch has begun to weather.

The thick, mighty hide of a fully grown
Water Fortress Dragon. It has excellent water retention;
when squeezed, water overflows.

The white carapace covering the
Frozen King Dragon's whole body. It is extremely hard;
no ordinary weapon can scratch it.

A charred talon of the Dark Thunder Wyvern.
Even damaged, it is highly practical;
so popular it is always in short supply.

A damaged wing of the Nether Thunder Dragon.
So wounded it could never flap again;
the pain of forcing flight is beyond imagining.

Blood and marrow fluid taken
from a freshly severed tail,
blended together. Freshness is its selling point.

Blood and marrow fluid taken
from a freshly severed tail,
blended together. This should make me stronger!
